<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia's Sin Heng Chan hit limit down.</title>
<headline>Malaysia's Sin Heng Chan hit limit down.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of feedmiller Sin Heng Chan Bhd hit limit down on requotation, falling 30 percent to 34.25 ringgit, down 14.50 ringgit.</p>
<p>The stock was requoted after being suspended from July 22. The company said earlier this week that the Securities Commission has rejected its plan to buy a British gaming firm.</p>
